        {
          "name": "Nasty Plot",
          "pokemon": "Palkia-Origin",
          "shiny": false,
          "gender": "DC",
          "levels": [],
          "description": "<p>Palkia-O is a strong setup sweeper that has an unremovable item and a strong matchup against the likes of <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/arceus-ground/bh/\" hreflang=\"en\">Arceus-Ground</a> and <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/ho-oh/bh/\" hreflang=\"en\">Ho-Oh</a>. Speed Boost denies offensive counterplay from Pokemon like <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/greninja-ash/bh/\" hreflang=\"en\">Ash-Greninja</a> and <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/flutter-mane/bh/\" hreflang=\"en\">Flutter Mane</a>, and it prevents slow pivots like Teleport <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/blissey/bh/\" hreflang=\"en\">Blissey</a> from forcing Palkia-O out via switching to Imposter users. Magic Guard can exploit defensive Pokemon that rely on status moves to deal damage, lets Palkia-O sit on common Knock Off users, and helps keep Dragon Energy's power high. Jungle Healing provides some recovery and removes debilitating status conditions like paralysis, but Strength Sap can provide much greater amount of healing. Pokemon like <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/necrozma-ultra/bh/\" hreflang=\"en\">Ultra Necrozma</a> and <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/gardevoir-mega/bh/\" hreflang=\"en\">Mega Gardevoir</a> appreciate Palkia-O beating Ho-Oh and Arceus-Ground, and they can help it beat checks like <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/audino-mega/bh/\" hreflang=\"en\">Mega Audino</a> and Blissey in return. Speed Boost Palkia-O essentially ceases to function if statused, so a status absorber like a Take Heart <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/arceus/bh/\" hreflang=\"en\">Arceus</a> forme can help. Teammates such as Blissey that can take on faster attackers like <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/eternatus/bh/\" hreflang=\"en\">Eternatus</a> and Flutter Mane are also greatly appreciated by Magic Guard variants. Imposter-proof Palkia-O with Ice Scales Mega Audino, <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/arceus-fairy/bh/\" hreflang=\"en\">Arceus-Fairy</a>, or Imposter <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/chansey/bh/\" hreflang=\"en\">Chansey</a>.</p>",
          "abilities": [
            "Speed Boost",
            "Magic Guard"
          ],
